  "label": "Racist Stereotype Mapping",
  "description": "The text 'why do white people smell like bologna?' is mapped onto the visual of the woman holding Grammy awards. The woman, representing 'white people' in the context of the stereotype, is juxtaposed with the offensive text to create an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the woman) is being equated with the derogatory textual concept (white people smelling like bologna). This mapping is hateful and dehumanizing, using the visual of a celebrated individual to contrast with the offensive stereotype.",
